{{JPExclusive}}
'''Dot Hero''' is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy that appears in the [[Dot Heroes Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Dot Hero
|image = E 476.png
|money drop = 450円 - 1,777円
|appearance = [[Dot Heroes Collaboration Event]]
}}

==Enemy==
Simply stall Dot Hero while using cats that outrange it such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] to kill it. Just be careful of its knockback ability.

